thin pack installation
├── when adding a local pack
│   ├── it copies only the manifest closure
│   └── it refuses to replace an existing pack
├── when the source contains an unsafe pack name
│   └── it refuses to write outside the packs directory
├── when selecting a pack subdirectory
│   └── it rejects paths outside the source
├── when the project packs directory escapes
│   └── it refuses to write outside the project
├── when adding a git repository
│   └── it clones and adds the pack
└── when parsing a git source
    ├── it expands a github shorthand
    └── it rejects an unknown source
